>:<fpage>1254</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16965708</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R9"><label>9. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Foulongne</surname> <given-names>V</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Olejnik</surname> <given-names>Y</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Perez</surname> <given-names>V</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Elaerts</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Rodiere</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Segondy</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Human bocavirus in French children.</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>12</volume>:<fpage>1251</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16965707</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Fry</surname> <given-names>AM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lu</surname> <given-names>X</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chittaganpitch</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Peret</surname> <given-names>T</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Fischer</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Dowell</surname> <given-names>SF</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Human bocavirus: a novel parvovirus epidemiologically associated with pneumonia requiring hospitalization in Thailand.</article-title><source>J Infect Dis</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>195</volume>:<fpage>1038</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>45</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/512163</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17330795</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R11"><label>11. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Kaplan</surname> <given-names>NM</given-name