en-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ritter</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hausler</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name> <article-title>High prevalence of human bocavirus detected in young children with severe acute lower respiratory tract disease by use of a standard PCR protocol and a novel real-time PCR protocol.</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>45</volume>:<fpage>1032</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>4</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JCM.01884-06</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17215343</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R14"><label>14. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Lu</surname> <given-names>X</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chittaganpitch</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Olsen</surname> <given-names>SJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Mackay</surname> <given-names>IM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Sloots</surname> <given-names>TP</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Fry</surname> <given-names>AM</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Real-time PCR assays for detection of bocavirus in human specimens.</article-title><source>J Clin Microbiol</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>44</volume>:<fpage>3231</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>5</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JCM.00889-06</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16954253</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Ma</surname> <given-names>X</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Endo</surname> <given-names>R</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ishiguro</surname> <given-names>N</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ebihara</surname> <given-names>T</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ishiko</surname> <given-names>H</given-